 Start it again to continue. Tasks that need an active agent will not run while it is stopped; hosted agents are managed separately in Nous Portal.\",\"question\":\"What happens when I stop my agent?\"}],\"title\":\"FAQs\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"33:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Nous Portal plans\",\"className\":\"landing-portal\",\"id\":\"portal\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Available plans\",\"className\":\"landing-plan-chips\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Free\",{\"tone\":\"outline\",\"children\":\"Free\"}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Plus\",{\"tone\":\"outline\",\"children\":\"Plus\"}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Super\",{\"tone\":\"outline\",\"children\":\"Super\"}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",\"Ultra\",{\"tone\":\"outline\",\"children\":\"Ultra\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full items-start gap-2.5 landing-section-title landing-portal-heading\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Nous Portal\",\"role\":\"$undefined\",\"data-type-role\":\"heading\",\"className\":\"text-cap-trim cap-rules text-[var(--hw-teams-ink)]\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"var(--font-rules-gothic-cnd)\",\"fontSize\":\"var(--hpv2-type-heading)\",\"fontWeight\":400,\"lineHeight\":1,\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"textTransform\":\"none\"}}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-[var(--hermes-primary)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"alt\":\"\",\"height\":24,\"src\":\"https://web-assets.nousresearch.com/marketing/6ae3c5b07622a9219fa0cd2d3cbc2e833d9c5aba/assets/hermes-agent/globe.svg\",\"width\":24}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-auto shrink-0 self-start text-[var(--hw-teams-ink)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"landing-portal-actions\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"href\":\"https://portal.nousresearch.com/\",\"size\":\"m\",\"variant\":\"primary\",\"children\":\"Create an account\"}],[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"href\":\"https://po